{"version":1,"key":"card:773","content":{"id":773,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4074c9ea-b82e-433c-9b74-8d0cec9ab087","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"野指针（Wild Pointer）是指不知道指向哪里的指针。和"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":6140,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":772,"collabId":"e86c2055-539d-47cd-82de-78c569d3dfd8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"悬空指针"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"不同，悬空指针至少曾经指向过有效内存，而野指针从一开始就没有被赋予合法的地址。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b4c379da-5479-4cb6-860d-892c4592aabe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最典型的情况是声明了指针变量但没有初始化，此时指针的值是栈上的随机垃圾数据："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"C","uuid":"599a2652-54d5-472f-b9c2-8037f6826f4f","collabId":"0bcfb43c-de6e-4366-a5db-2fa771e102c9","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"int main() {\n    int *p;     // 未初始化\n    *p = 10;    // 错误：p 指向哪里完全不知道\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f9548907-26ee-4f8c-a36c-442a6f111d75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一种是手动将指针赋值为某个任意地址，这同样极其危险："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"C","uuid":"79811e47-2783-4dd0-9257-ead451efecdb","collabId":"4b65c6d2-07d3-4509-9e93-7f02a25c9850","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"int *p = (int*)0x12345678;\n*p = 10; // 极其危险"}],"tags":["C","内存管理/野指针"],"createTime":1782913185239,"updateTime":1789269343957,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1789269343957},"links":{"card:772":{"key":"card:772","type":"card","id":772}}}